{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38332","headline":"登鹳雀楼 · 吴融","name":"登鹳雀楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸟在林梢脚底看，夕阳无际戍烟残。\n冻开河水奔浑急，雪洗条山错落寒。\n始爲一名抛故国，近因多难怕长安。\n祖鞭掉折徒爲尔，赢得云溪负钓竿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38332.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38332","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}